          "heading": "Fiji score 314 points and concede 351 over last 11 tests",
          "body": "The senior men's national side averaged 28.5 points scored and 31.9 points conceded per game across their last 11 fixtures. During this window, the Flying Fijians accumulated a total of 314 points while shipping 351 to their opponents. The team's biggest win in this period came in September 2025, when Fiji defeated Canada 63-10 on home soil during the Pacific Nations Cup knockout stage."
