          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Will Joseph stakes England claim as Gloucester thrash Harlequins in Premiership rout",
          "body": "Gloucester centre Will Joseph bolstered his chances for an England recall during Saturday’s emphatic 48-0 victory over Harlequins. Joseph was the pick of the backline in an eight-try demolition at Kingsholm, scoring once and repeatedly breaking the line to pressure the Harlequins defence. With Steve Borthwick finalising his squad for the upcoming Test against Australia, Joseph’s physical performance suggests he is ready for further caps. Meanwhile, Northampton’s George Hendy impressed at full-back, though regular international Tommy Freeman struggled in the same role."
