        {
          "kicker": "PREVIOUS MEETING",
          "heading": "France face Fiji having won their last meeting 34-21 in November 2025",
          "body": "France's senior men's side occupy third place in the Nations Championship table following their 42-15 victory against Japan in Round 3. Fabien Galthié's side have recorded two wins and one defeat across their opening three fixtures, scoring 116 points while conceding 75 in the tournament so far. Les Bleus next face Fiji in Round 4, a side they defeated 34-21 during an international friendly at home in November 2025. This remains the only recent result between the two teams as the competition resumes."
        },
