          "kicker": "Match result",
          "heading": "Ireland women seal seven-try victory over Japan in Cork test",
          "body": "The Ireland women's side secured a comprehensive 43-19 win over Japan at Virgin Media Park on Saturday. Despite conceding an early try, the hosts dominated the remainder of the match, crossing the whitewash four times before half-time. Beibhinn Parsons extended her record of total Ireland tries to 25 during the second period, while debuts for Sophie Barrett and Alana McInerney were marked by tries off the bench. The team now turns its attention to an upcoming series against South Africa."
        },
