          "body": "The Italy men's side has reached a peak position of No. 8 in the world rankings on two separate occasions. This high-water mark for the national team was first achieved in 2007. The squad most recently equalled this ranking milestone in 2024. These figures represent the highest level the team has reached in the world standings to date."
