          "kicker": "Selection risk",
          "heading": "Bath monitor Edinburgh scrum-half Hector Patterson amid international allegiance switch",
          "body": "Bath are monitoring Edinburgh scrum-half Hector Patterson as the 21-year-old approaches the end of his current contract. While Patterson has represented Scotland at age-grade level—including winning the 2024 World Rugby U20 Trophy—he remains eligible to play for England through a grandparent. With his contract expiring at the end of this season, his potential move to the Premiership could complicate his international future, as he has yet to be tied to Scotland at the senior international level."
