          "heading": "Josh Adams eyes third World Cup as fitness return nears",
          "body": "Wales wing Josh Adams has confirmed he is targeting a third Rugby World Cup appearance as he nears a return to action. The 31-year-old missed the international defeat to South Africa in July with a calf injury and has been sidelined for Cardiff’s opening fixtures. Adams is now back in training and expects to be available for international duty in November, as the squad prepares for the upcoming Nations Championship tests against Japan, New Zealand, and Australia."
