          "body": "The Japan women's side concluded their tour with a 43-19 defeat against Ireland at Virgin Media Park on Saturday. Despite an early try from Sakurako Korai and further scores from Nami Asari and Nijiho Nagata, the visitors were unable to contain an expansive Irish attack. The match followed a competitive outing in Galway the previous weekend, marking the end of a demanding two-match series for the Sakura XV in the northern hemisphere."
